  "oneLiner": "Connect staff availability and driver qualifications to store delivery planning.",
  "summary": "An academic Java desktop system joins employee administration and weekly shift scheduling with deliveries, truck selection and driver assignment. Its most useful engineering story is the boundary between two business areas: HR provides availability, while delivery planning checks driver qualifications and reports assignments back.",
