    {
      "title": "Handle changes during a delivery",
      "summary": "Delivery stops are grouped by origin and delivery zone. A journey tracks visited stops and invokes replanning when a measured load exceeds the truck limit.",
      "details": [
        "Replanning can try a replacement truck/driver, remove a stop, cancel the form or reweigh.",
        "Cancelled undelivered stops return to the pending set.",
        "Origin/zone grouping is implemented; route-distance optimization is not established."
      ],
